      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA DIVERSION (1) is having his first look at this track. Scored in best time on card (34.14) latest winning by 11 lengths at The Meadows in a Grade 4/5. Boasts four wins from four starts out of this box. Looks the one to beat. DAKOTA SHINE (7) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors three starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (30.73) at this track over 530m. Can measure up. PAW PHELPS (3) was a respectable 30.50 winner of a Invitation at this track last start. This tougher but looks a leading chance again. CARE FACTOR (5) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
